Package: spelunk
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Installed-Size: @INSTALLED_SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Dietrich Fdz <atomikbiohazard@gmail.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/AtomikBioHazard/spelunk
Description: Full-text document search inside the COSMIC launcher
 Spelunk adds an "in: <words>" search to the Super-key launcher on
 Pop!_OS / COSMIC, powered by Recoll. After installing, run
 "spelunk-setup" once as your normal user.
